---
title: Hypothesis only - alternate conceptual model
---
%% Non-normative hypothesis, not the implemented model or API.
%% Authority: docs/domain/model.yaml and ADR 0004; no new context, event or persistence commitment.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor user as User
    participant mini as LINE MINI App
    participant liff as LINE Login / LIFF
    participant geo as Browser Geolocation
    participant api as Go HTTP Adapter
    participant verify as LINE Verify API
    participant identity as Identity + Account
    participant access as Membership + Access
    participant attendance as Attendance Application / Domain
    participant db as Firestore Adapter
    participant queue as Cloud Tasks
    participant time as Timekeeping Worker

    user->>mini: 開啟 MINI App
    mini->>liff: liff.init()
    mini->>liff: liff.getIDToken()
    liff-->>mini: ID Token
    mini->>api: POST /session (ID Token)
    api->>verify: verify ID Token
    verify-->>api: LINE subject / token claims
    api->>identity: Resolve ExternalIdentity -> User
    identity->>db: Read or link User
    db-->>identity: User
    api->>identity: Create Session
    identity->>db: Persist Session
    api-->>mini: Authenticated Session

    user->>mini: 選擇 Enterprise / Organization / Team scope
    mini->>geo: getCurrentPosition()
    geo-->>mini: latitude / longitude / accuracy / timestamp
    mini->>api: POST /attendance/check-in (Session, Scope, Coordinates)
    api->>access: Resolve Membership and Authorize(User, Scope)
    access->>db: Read Membership / RoleAssignment / Role / Permission
    db-->>access: Membership and grants
    alt membership or permission denied
        access-->>api: Rejected
        api-->>mini: 403 Forbidden
    else authorized
        access-->>api: Authorized
        api->>attendance: Apply AttendancePolicy and open AttendanceSession
        alt hard submission window or invariant rejected
            attendance-->>api: Rejected
            api-->>mini: Validation error
        else accepted
            attendance->>db: Save AttendanceSession (idempotent)
            db-->>attendance: Committed
            attendance-->>api: AttendanceSession
            api-->>mini: Check-in success
            opt Unimplemented hypothesis: requires approved publication contract
                api->>queue: Hypothesis only: future versioned event after atomic outbox commit
                queue->>time: Process attendance event
                time->>db: Create or update TimeEntry
                time->>db: Aggregate Timesheet when required
            end
        end
    end
    Note over mini,api: Browser Geolocation is evidence, not trusted proof of physical presence.

    Note over attendance,db: Current ATT-003: successful assignment/kind retry returns existing Punch; no Attendance publication contract.
